---
description: Fork-local agent contract (overrides openmontage.mdc)
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENT_LOCAL.md` in the repo root before acting.

It is this fork's agent contract: task routing, autonomy, checkpoint
pre-authorization, presentation rules, non-negotiables, machine facts, and
current status. It **overrides `openmontage.mdc`, `AGENTS.md`, and
`AGENT_GUIDE.md` where they disagree**, including the "read AGENT_GUIDE.md before
responding to ANY user message" rule. `AGENT_GUIDE.md` is a reference to consult
per task, not a preamble.

`AGENT_LOCAL.md` is untracked and git-excluded, so it will not appear in
`git status`.
